    "title": "Company of the Day: Dusty's Outdoor Media - NewsBreak",
    "text": "billboardinsider.com\nwebsite\nEffingham\nCompany of the Day: Dusty’s Outdoor Media\n21 hours ago\nHeadquarters: 1207 Network Center Blvd, Suite 3C, Effingham, IL 62401. Dusty’s Outdoor Media operates a billboard plant with over 358 faces in Illinois. The company sold 200 faces in Tennessee and Indiana to Trailhead Media in 2021. Dusty’s is a member of the OAAI and an Operator Associate with the IBOUSA. Dusty’s was founded by Dick Rhodes, the company’s Chairman of the Board. Travis Rhodes is President. Here’s our 2023 interview with Travis Rhodes.\n1",
